questions.question:
In the following series, identify the number that needs to be changed to form the
Fibonacci series.<br/><br/>
1, 1, 2, 3, 6, 8, 13, 21,&hellip;

questions.explanation:
\[\begin{aligned} 
2-5x \leq -\frac{6x-5}{3}\\ 
1-9x\leq 0\\ 
\Rightarrow 1\leq 9x\Rightarrow x\geq \frac{1}{9} 
\end{aligned}\]
